{"ts":"2026-07-30T22:37:54.424Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"7af60c336d5bedfb02d08cad","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-vcs-48q3"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Per-field record merge so structured data never line-merges"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The reason the VCS exists. A record merge compares base, ours and theirs field by field: a field only one side changed takes that side, a field both sides changed to the same value is not a conflict, append-only sequences union while preserving order, and set-valued fields union. Only a genuine scalar disagreement conflicts, and it conflicts on that field alone rather than poisoning the whole document."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:vcs"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-30T22:37:54.424Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-30T22:37:54.424Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Two agents editing different fields of one record merge cleanly; identical concurrent edits do not conflict; append-only history from both sides unions with no loss and no duplication; a real scalar disagreement reports exactly the conflicting field with base, ours and theirs; no record merge path can emit line-based conflict markers"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"e540c8c4e38e5c3f10ae8ff992719a5a16f48ab901fac6f90ffe8d44927d31d1","message":""}
